electric switch board design for home","electric switch replacement","16 amp switch repair","dp switch repairing","32a dp switch repair","16 amp modular switch","16 ampere","#auzaarnow"],"channelId":"UCo-VpMcUBe6HoFRyAellnfQ","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"In this video, I have shown how to replace basic electric switch from switch board. I recommend to use electric gloves for those who are performing this type of repairs in your home. This video includes professional work and not recommended to be carried out by minors or unauthorized work men.\n\nPlease read the instructions completely and understand each and every step before performing any electric works in your houses. \n\nNote: If you're not knowing the complete process of replacing the switch then consult a electrician to get it fixed.\n\nIMPORTANT Note: This electric switch replacement needs huge concentration and highly recommended to switch off the Miniature Circuit Breaker(MCB in short form) before carrying out this work.\n\n\nMy playlist links are below:\n\nHOW TO RESTORE ANYTHING IN HOUSE: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-7fZOYRCzY\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lK6Yugcaz3uHqYhhJKMHl7j\n\nEASY MOTORCYCLE SERVICE GUIDE: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1i9JAXo7Rrk\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lL4fCdMLs22kpMSuPltsdhA\n\nINSTANT EASY COOKING VIDEOS: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ja_ppFwwCH0\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lLtGFVPU5E_YfvDUqlYvGua\n\nLATEST WINDOWS TRICKS: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yCRypL2q2z0\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lLrMvAbT5NwMSY35i5uRApM\n\nLATEST ANDROID TRICKS: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rwOIildmf4Y\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lJjuqvpLtcEiRqqn2uNqtXB\n\nUNBOX ANYTHING: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GU6Ukb7KjX0\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lL1wrFSD7uM2jv0dG0W_ijo\n\nSELENIUM/JAVA RARE VIDEOS ON YOUTUBE: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JXT0bjwp-Zg\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lJEqFvFy-3RVG1qBrPGzPZe\n\n#switch\n#board #home #design #swing #spiral #switching #gm #goldmedal #gold #medal #brand #cena #16amps #repair #electric #electricity #board #wiring #\n#replacement\n#electric\n#technician\n#easy\n#tips\n#tricks","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b1f-wxCEen0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLAJ3QVNusekVs-TIeJxc2l9VluOGw","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b1f-wxCEen0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLB5F_NWb-9lYSjNc4n1EfBtLRK7vA","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b1f-wxCEen0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLAIYMIF12zpC2TZiMr6U7_DFNcv1g","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b1f-wxCEen0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLCwcdpER-x96bmEpYWe4-EsgV14sA","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b1f-wxCEen0/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"129175","author":"Motorcycle and Repairs","isPrivate":false,"isUnpluggedCorpus":false,"isLiveContent":false,"isTvfilmVideo":false},"annotations":[{"playerAnnotationsExpandedRenderer":{"featuredChannel":{"startTimeMs":"0","endTimeMs":"672000","watermark":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/an/o-VpMcUBe6HoFRyAellnfQ/featured_channel.jpg?v=64174b6f","width":40,"height":40}]},"trackingParams":"CAkQ8zciEwiVkd_t2NKVAxXoyHsAHamPMyA=","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CAkQ8zciEwiVkd_t2NKVAxXoyHsAHamPMyAyAml2ygEEx6cM8w==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/channel/UCo-VpMcUBe6HoFRyAellnfQ","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_CHANNEL","rootVe":3611,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"UCo-VpMcUBe6HoFRyAellnfQ"}},"channelName":"Motorcycle and Repairs","subscribeButton":{"subscribeButtonRenderer":{"buttonText":{"runs":[{"text":"سبسکرائب کریں"}]},"subscribed":false,"enabled":true,"type":"FREE","channelId":"UCo-VpMcUBe6HoFRyAel