o includes professional work and not recommended to be carried out by minors or unauthorized work men.\n\nPlease read the instructions completely and understand each and every step before performing any electric works in your houses. \n\nNote: If you're not knowing the complete process of replacing the switch then consult a electrician to get it fixed.\n\nIMPORTANT Note: This electric switch replacement needs huge concentration and highly recommended to switch off the Miniature Circuit Breaker(MCB in short form) before carrying out this work.\n\n\nMy playlist links are below:\n\nHOW TO RESTORE ANYTHING IN HOUSE:    • ویڈیو  \n\nEASY MOTORCYCLE SERVICE GUIDE:    • Spark plug/igniter cleaning at home | Baja...  \n\nINSTANT EASY COOKING VIDEOS:    • ویڈیو  \n\nLATEST WINDOWS TRICKS:    • ویڈیو  \n\nLATEST ANDROID TRICKS:    • Whatsapp deleted messages older than 1 mon...  \n\nUNBOX ANYTHING:    • Allen Key | Hex Key unboxing | Flipkart pr...  \n\nSELENIUM/JAVA RARE VIDEOS ON YOUTUBE:    • ویڈیو  \n\n#switch\n#board #home #design #swing #spiral #switching #gm #goldmedal #gold #medal #brand #cena #16amps #repair #electric #electricity #board #wiring #\n#replacement\n#electric\n#technician\n#easy\n#tips\n#tricks","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":801,"length":12,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJkCEM2rARgBIhMI6PDe7djSlQMVys-OCR3UuSQZygEEx6cM8w==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=P-7fZOYRCzY\u0026list=PL63MYXNe82lK6Yugcaz3uHqYhhJKMHl7j\u0026index=1","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"P-7fZOYRCzY","playlistId":"PL63MYXNe82lK6Yugcaz3uHqYhhJKMHl7j","index":0,"startTimeSeconds":0,"loggingContext":{"vssLoggingContext":{"serializedContextData":"GiJQTDYzTVlYTmU4MmxLNll1Z2NhejN1SHFZaGhKS01IbDdq"}},"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr1---sn-2uja-2xfs.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026o